<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`start` subscribes to the wiki's change events, opens the keyed reconcile queue, hears each mirrored bag's own store and marks every root a mount scan finds. `stop` ends the settle waits and drains the queue. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

